tor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-b563afd\" data-id=\"b563afd\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-inner-section elementor-element elementor-element-b2de1df elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"b2de1df\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-6a3378f\" data-id=\"6a3378f\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a8f24bd elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"a8f24bd\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2><b>\u00bfQu\u00e9 es la optimizaci\u00f3n SAP?<\/b><\/h2>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8ebec02 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"8ebec02\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">La optimizaci\u00f3n SAP consiste en identificar oportunidades de mejora dentro del entorno SAP para incrementar su eficiencia, estabilidad y alineaci\u00f3n con los objetivos estrat\u00e9gicos de la organizaci\u00f3n.<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Este proceso puede involucrar aspectos funcionales, t\u00e9cnicos y operativos orientados a maximizar el desempe\u00f1o del sistema y facilitar la ejecuci\u00f3n de los procesos empresariales.<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">La optimizaci\u00f3n puede aplicarse tanto en organizaciones que han utilizado SAP durante a\u00f1os como en aquellas que recientemente han completado una implementaci\u00f3n o migraci\u00f3n.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-402f6cd\" data-id=\"402f6cd\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5ab2fdb elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer\" data-id=\"5ab2fdb\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"spacer.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer-inner\"><\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-1aaad30 elementor-section-full_width elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"1aaad30\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-extended\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-c3f9423\" data-id=\"c3f9423\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0c82064 elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer\" data-id=\"0c82064\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"spacer.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer-inner\"><\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-eba9d8c\" data-id=\"eba9d8c\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-inner-section elementor-element elementor-element-d872cbf elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"d872cbf\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-3802e84\" data-id=\"3802e84\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-96fe027 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"96fe027\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2 style=\"text-align: left;\"><b>\u00bfPor qu\u00e9 es importante optimizar SAP?<\/b><\/h2>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ba685d1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-html\" data-id=\"ba685d1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"html.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"sap-247\">\r\n  <style>\r\n    \/* Estilos base del contenedor *\/\r\n    .sap-247 {\r\n      font-size: 14px;\r\n      color: #000000;\r\n      line-height: 1.5;\r\n      max-width: 800px;\r\n      margin: 0 auto;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    .sap-247 p {\r\n      color: #000000;\r\n      margin: 0 0 1em 0;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    \/* Estilos para los H3 con bullet magenta incorporado *\/\r\n    .sap-247 h3 {\r\n      color: #071C3B; \/* Azul profundo *\/\r\n      font-size: 16px; \r\n      font-weight: 700;\r\n      margin: 1.5em 0 0.5em 0;\r\n      position: relative;\r\n      padding-left: 20px; \/* Espacio para el bullet *\/\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    \/* Creaci\u00f3n del bullet para el H3 *\/\r\n    .sap-247 h3::before {\r\n      content: \"\";\r\n      background-color: #EE5781; \/* Magenta *\/\r\n      width: 8px;\r\n      height: 8px;\r\n      border-radius: 50%;\r\n      position: absolute;\r\n      left: 2px;\r\n      top: 0.5em; \/* Alineaci\u00f3n vertical *\/\r\n    }\r\n  <\/style>\r\n\r\n  <h3>Los procesos empresariales evolucionan<\/h3>\r\n  <p>Las configuraciones iniciales pueden dejar de responder adecuadamente a las nuevas necesidades del negocio.<\/p>\r\n\r\n  <h3>El rendimiento impacta la productividad<\/h3>\r\n  <p>Los tiempos de respuesta deficientes afectan la experiencia de los usuarios y la eficiencia operativa.<\/p>\r\n\r\n  <h3>Existen oportunidades de mejora continua<\/h3>\r\n  <p>Muchas organizaciones utilizan solo una parte del potencial disponible dentro de SAP.<\/p>\r\n\r\n  <h3>La transformaci\u00f3n digital exige agilidad<\/h3>\r\n  <p>Las empresas necesitan plataformas capaces de adaptarse r\u00e1pidamente a nuevas demandas.<\/p>\r\n\r\n<\/div>\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-fc25566 elementor-section-full_width elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"fc25566\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-extended\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-bac8c12\" data-id=\"bac8c12\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-39fafb0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"39fafb0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2><b>Beneficios de la optimizaci\u00f3n SAP<\/b><\/h2>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-abc3080 elementor-widget elementor-widget-html\" data-id=\"abc3080\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"html.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<link href=\"https:\/\/fonts.googleapis.com\/css2?family=Raleway:wght@400;600;700;800&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\r\n<style>\r\n  .sap-grid-container-dark {\r\n    font-family: 'Raleway', sans-serif;\r\n    font-size: 1em;\r\n    color: #000000;\r\n    line-height: 1.25; \/* Interlineado compacto *\/\r\n    max-width: 1000px;\r\n    margin: 0 auto;\r\n    \r\n    \/* Configuraci\u00f3n de la rejilla a 3 columnas *\/\r\n    display: grid;\r\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\r\n    column-gap: 25px;\r\n    row-gap: 25px;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  \/* T\u00edtulo principal (si se llega a usar, ocupa las tres columnas) *\/\r\n  .sap-grid-container-dark h2 {\r\n    grid-column: span 3;\r\n    font-family: 'Raleway', sans-serif;\r\n    font-weight: 800;\r\n    font-size: 1.9em;\r\n    color: #000000;\r\n    margin-top: 0;\r\n    margin-bottom: 0.2em;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  \/* Tarjeta contenedora con borde morado para cada secci\u00f3n 